1735
01:28:49.100 --> 01:28:51.282
And so how do you measure that?

1736
01:28:51.282 --> 01:28:52.197
I feel safe.
I mean, that would be

1737
01:28:52.197 --> 01:28:54.164
something you probably wouldn't have thought of, right.

1738
01:28:54.164 --> 01:28:55.997
Never thought of it.

