01:29:11.130 --> 01:29:12.080
Tell me what that means.

1745
01:29:12.080 --> 01:29:14.280
Like the way I think about that,

1746
01:29:14.280 --> 01:29:18.160
and tell me if this is wrong, of course, there's that adage,

1747
01:29:18.160 --> 01:29:19.530
like don't give a fish,

1748
